<title>UK: Chiroscience to start clinical trials on PDE IV.</title>
<headline>Chiroscience to start clinical trials on PDE IV.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drug discovery group Chiroscience Group Plc said on Tuesday it was to start clinical trials on a PDE IV inhibitor drug for asthma.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the chosen candidate, D4418, had shown superior performance in laboratory trials to other similar drugs.</p>
